OL,3,GNEWSAHospice pauses some services amid
OL,4,Afunding woes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospice has announced a pause in some
OL,7,Fof its services as the sector continues
OL,8,Fto face funding challenges.
OL,10,FThe Shakespeare Hospice in Shottery,
OL,11,FWarwickshire, said it was temporarily
OL,12,Fhalting its day hospice services, and
OL,13,Fits occupational therapy offer would
OL,14,Falso close at the end of September.
OL,16,FBosses said they were navigating "one
OL,17,Fof the most difficult funding climates"
OL,18,Fthe sector had ever faced, with NHS
OL,19,Fcash only covering about 12% of its
OL,20,Fincome.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
